The STL files in print/sesame/ are from the Sesame robot project:

    https://github.com/dorianborian/sesame-robot
    commit 86d2bf8099754fd548c7cf98ee11fc9e9cdb5092 (2026-08-23)
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 -- see sesame/LICENSE

They are vendored here unmodified, so that one folder can be dragged into a
slicer, and pinned to a commit so a reprint six months from now is the same
part. Re-fetch from upstream rather than editing them in place.

The STL files in print/enforcer/ are generated by ../make_stl.py and are
part of this project. Regenerate with `python3 make_stl.py` -- do not edit
the STLs by hand, since they are build output.
